{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-202":{"renderings":[{"id":"0372c4809613ab92","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-202"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Used to express 'if it comes to...', 'when it becomes the case that...'."},{"id":"908e2ab2444353e3","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-202"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The ～となったら grammar point is used to describe a situation where, if matters progress to that stage, a certain action or outcome will follow. It’s often translated as 'when it comes to...', 'if it comes to...'."},{"id":"16c66a236618d5a8","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-202"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Verb-casual + となったら / Noun + となったら"},{"id":"9e35ff1f5802c3f3","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-202"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"となったら: if it comes to that (行くとなったら)."},{"id":"fa19f1c414ee3570","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"conditional"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Conditional (If / Assuming That)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"conditional"}}]},"n1-202#86159335c133":{"renderings":[{"id":"2731d118d54a1b21","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-202"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"If it comes to going on a trip, we have to pack."}]},"n1-202#50f5d5cad41d":{"renderings":[{"id":"f95c939f6ef9bfb3","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-202"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"What should I do if I fail the exam?"}]},"n1-202#dd2eba0a188b":{"renderings":[{"id":"cac709c449365522","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-202"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"If it comes to breaking up with her, I’ll be very sad."}]},"n1-202#0510f5e65e55":{"renderings":[{"id":"3949d574b44df081","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-202"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"When it comes to getting married, life will probably change drastically."}]}}}